    "consistency_verdict": "The S_K form SURVIVES this test: with theta_3 = 0 every extracted theta_A is real and every pair stays boost-dominated (theta < ln q0), so the binding sign never flips across the series -- exactly what `binding_sign_from_angular` requires of a physical configuration. The extracted theta grows smoothly with A, reaching 75.1% of ln q0 at the top of the series.",
    "falsifiable_prediction_TESTED_AND_DEFUSED": {
      "prediction_as_made": "Under the S_K reading, theta_A -> ln q0 is a WALL where the per-pair unit vanishes. At A = 41 the series had reached 72.4% of it, so I predicted that extending the mirror ladder 'should show kappa continuing to fall toward zero', and called this 'a sharp, cheap test that distinguishes the S_K reading from coth-saturation, which predicts kappa -> 1, not -> 0'.",
      "what_happened": "The ladder WAS extended, in the same session, from A = 41 to A = 63 (11 further mirror pairs already in the corpus). kappa does NOT continue toward zero -- it FLATTENS, from 1.531 at A = 41 to 1.413 at A = 63: a 7.7% decline across a 54% increase in A, against the factor 2.1 seen over A = 3..41. theta flattens with it, 0.724 -> 0.749 of ln q0.",
      "verdict": "The S_K form itself is NOT falsified: theta stays real, stays boost-dominated, stays monotone within tolerance, and the A^(1/6) description IMPROVED (2.80% -> 2.33%). What is falsified is my claim that this was a sharp discriminator. Under theta ~ A^(1/6), reaching the wall needs A ~ (1/0.75)^6 * 63 ~ 350 -- far beyond the last bound mirror pair. The wall is UNREACHABLE in this series, so the test cannot discriminate, and the two readings are degenerate over the whole accessible range. I proposed it as cheap and decisive; it is cheap and indecisive, and that is recorded rather than restated as a success.",
      "what_the_extension_DID_settle": "Not this, but something else: H_coth's scatter IMPROVED with the extension (4.25% -> 3.50% on bound pairs) while its rivals did not (H_FH_Z 4.52% -> 4.39%, H_FH_A 5.50%). The three are no longer statistically tied. Combined with the round-5 withdrawal of the H_FH warrant, coth-saturation is now the only reading with both the best fit and a structural story -- though 'best of three' is not the same as derived."
    },
    "honest_scope": "This is a CONSISTENCY test, not a derivation. theta_K remains the open G3 datum (bean qou-qnnq); nothing here computes it from the categorical drivers. The normalisation theta_3 is a free choice, and the reported power-law scan is descriptive -- with one free scale it cannot confirm a law, only reveal gross misbehaviour. What the probe establishes is narrower and real: the S_K form is not excluded, and it converts the held-fixed-unit confound into a specific open quantity that the corpus is already trying to derive.",
